00:49:58.830 --> 00:50:01.080
then the likelihood of
you being able to pay

00:50:01.080 --> 00:50:03.450
for the citizenship,
which is expensive, right?

00:50:03.450 --> 00:50:05.940
Unless you remain on
government services but also

00:50:05.940 --> 00:50:07.979
be able to sit and take
the citizenship exam,

00:50:07.979 --> 00:50:10.320
which is an English language exam,

00:50:10.320 --> 00:50:13.140
they actually test you on
your English is very low.

00:50:13.140 --> 00:50:15.750
So, actually in an intervention
