00:50:15.750 --> 00:50:18.780
I started a citizenship
clinic at Boston University.

00:50:18.780 --> 00:50:21.900
What I do is I bring people
who are learning Arabic,

00:50:21.900 --> 00:50:23.790
students who are learning
