00:50:50.700 --> 00:50:52.170
And we think about family reification

00:50:52.170 --> 00:50:53.370
just on the basis of the laws,

00:50:53.370 --> 00:50:55.140
but you need the resources to even be able

00:50:55.140 --> 00:50:58.143
to qualify under those laws for sure.

00:50:59.370 --> 00:51:01.230
In there are, you are absolutely right,

00:51:01.230 --> 00:51:03.600
there are different restrictions
on family reunification.

00:51:03.600 --> 00:51:06.240
So, there's the immediate
family which you can bring in

00:51:06.240 --> 00:51:08.593
the United States prior to
securing your refugee status.

00:51:08.593 --> 00:51:10.860
And in Canada, in some instances,

00:51:10.860 --> 00:51:12.510
in Germany, they actually truncated that.

00:51:12.510 --> 00:51:14.160
That's why it moved from
three year residencies

00:51:14.160 --> 00:51:15.090
to one year residency.

00:51:15.090 --> 00:51:17.190
So, that's a really
interesting case to look at

00:51:17.190 --> 00:51:18.720
in terms of family reunification

00:51:18.720 --> 00:51:20.370
because under subsidiary protection,

00:51:20.370 --> 00:51:21.480
which is the one year protection,

00:51:21.480 --> 00:51:22.677
you cannot reunify your family.

00:51:22.677 --> 00:51:25.080
And that was their attempt to stop.

00:51:25.080 --> 00:51:28.170
And that actually a lot
of people self deported

00:51:28.170 --> 00:51:31.680
because they were fathers
who got to Germany

00:51:31.680 --> 00:51:33.720
and their intention was
to unify their family.

00:51:33.720 --> 00:51:35.070
They just didn't want
them to go on the boat

00:51:35.070 --> 00:51:36.030
with them 'cause they were, you know,

00:51:36.030 --> 00:51:37.320
worried about their family's safety.

00:51:37.320 --> 00:51:39.270
And also 'cause it's very expensive.

00:51:39.270 --> 00:51:40.620
So, they waited until they got to Germany

00:51:40.620 --> 00:51:42.300
and they tried to reunify
with their families.

00:51:42.300 --> 00:51:45.120
And then when they got the one
year subsidiary protection,

00:51:45.120 --> 00:51:46.800
their families are In unsafe positions

00:51:46.800 --> 00:51:48.180
in refugee camps and other places.

00:51:48.180 --> 00:51:51.453
So, they just went back and
it's a really sad, sad scenario.

