00:52:31.140 --> 00:52:34.530
but in the German case,
in the German case,

00:52:34.530 --> 00:52:37.068
it happens, in Europe, I'm sorry,

00:52:37.068 --> 00:52:40.260
I told Leslie that I tend to veer,

00:52:40.260 --> 00:52:43.560
