00:53:45.390 --> 00:53:46.770
As though they didn't
do the Holocaust, right?

00:53:46.770 --> 00:53:48.747
And so like, you know,
what does it mean to,

00:53:48.747 --> 00:53:50.880
what does culture mean in that regard?

00:53:50.880 --> 00:53:53.389
And I argue that this is a
story of race and racism.

00:53:53.389 --> 00:53:56.640
This is an ordinal
categorization of people, right?

00:53:56.640 --> 00:53:58.500
And so, you know, when we
think about these things,

00:53:58.500 --> 00:54:00.126
we have to put them in that context.

00:54:00.126 --> 00:54:04.800
And I think in Germany, in one's
