00:54:10.020 --> 00:54:13.140
Germany has a massive
history with Neo, you know,

00:54:13.140 --> 00:54:15.690
they have massive neo-Nazi elements

00:54:15.690 --> 00:54:17.733
and there's just not that much pushback.

00:54:19.260 --> 00:54:22.440
And there's really American,
not American History, sorry,

00:54:22.440 --> 00:54:24.595
there's a podcast called "Something X"

00:54:24.595 --> 00:54:25.650
in the New York Times.

00:54:25.650 --> 00:54:27.390
