00:54:27.390 --> 00:54:29.280
That was about Germany and about race

00:54:29.280 --> 00:54:31.530
and racism in Germany and about, you know,

00:54:31.530 --> 00:54:34.650
how people experience it
and the neo Nazi movement

00:54:34.650 --> 00:54:35.790
and how it's infiltrated also

00:54:35.790 --> 00:54:37.980
with the policing, et cetera there.

